    "text_full": " Geoffrey Litt\nProjects\nWriting\nInspirations\nSubscribe:\nNewsletter \nTwitter \nMastodon \nRSS \nContact\nEmail me \nInspirations\n\nHere’s a very incomplete list of people whose work I’ve found inspirational. If your taste is similar to mine, maybe you’ll get some inspiration from their work too.\n\nBret Victor\nAlan Kay\nChris Granger\nJonathan Edwards\nKerry Chang\nDoug Engelbart\nDaniel Jackson\nNeil Postman\nSeymour Papert\nCyrus Omar\nBrad Myers\nElena Glassman\nGlen Chiacchieri\nAmy Ko\nMichael Nielsen\nLea Verou\n\nAnd here’s a photo of my computing bookshelf as of November 2020, with some of the books that have influenced me the most:"
}